{"route":"/docs/4.0/utilities/sizing/","version":"4.0","renderedVersion":"4.0","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Sizing","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Easily make an element as wide or as tall (relative to its parent) with our width and height utilities."},"blocks":[{"id":"content--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Width and height utilities are generated from the <code>$sizes</code> Sass map in <code>_variables.scss</code>. Includes support for <code>25%</code>, <code>50%</code>, <code>75%</code>, and <code>100%</code> by default. Modify those values as you need to generate different utilities here."},{"id":"content--example-1","type":"demo","key":"12376b29da2ea51742de","height":228},{"id":"content--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"w-25 p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width 25%</div>\n<div class=\"w-50 p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width 50%</div>\n<div class=\"w-75 p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width 75%</div>\n<div class=\"w-100 p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width 100%</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"content--example-2","type":"demo","key":"af8168b3fee63fb4e34d","height":147},{"id":"content--code-2","type":"code","value":"<div style=\"height: 100px; background-color: rgba(255,0,0,0.1);\">\n  <div class=\"h-25 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height 25%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-50 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height 50%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-75 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height 75%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-100 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height 100%</div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"content--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"You can also use <code>max-width: 100%;</code> and <code>max-height: 100%;</code> utilities as needed."},{"id":"content--example-3","type":"demo","key":"586e9b9cc5a53aae68a9","height":147},{"id":"content--code-3","type":"code","value":"<img class=\"mw-100\" src=\"...\" alt=\"Max-width 100%\">","language":"html"},{"id":"content--example-4","type":"demo","key":"94920b6b666dab442bee","height":147},{"id":"content--code-4","type":"code","value":"<div style=\"height: 100px; background-color: rgba(255,0,0,0.1);\">\n  <div class=\"mh-100\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 200px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,0.1);\">Max-height 100%</div>\n</div>","language":"html"}],"demos":[{"key":"12376b29da2ea51742de","html":"\n<div class=\"w-25 p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width 25%</div>\n<div class=\"w-50 p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width 50%</div>\n<div class=\"w-75 p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width 75%</div>\n<div class=\"w-100 p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width 100%</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"af8168b3fee63fb4e34d","html":"\n<div style=\"height: 100px; background-color: rgba(255,0,0,0.1);\">\n  <div class=\"h-25 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height 25%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-50 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height 50%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-75 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height 75%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-100 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height 100%</div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"586e9b9cc5a53aae68a9","html":"\n<img class=\"mw-100\" data-src=\"holder.js/1000px100?text=Max-width%20%3D%20100%25\" alt=\"Max-width 100%\">\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"94920b6b666dab442bee","html":"\n<div style=\"height: 100px; background-color: rgba(255,0,0,0.1);\">\n  <div class=\"mh-100\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 200px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,0.1);\">Max-height 100%</div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Getting started","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/download/"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/contents/"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/browsers-devices/"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/javascript/"},{"en":"Theming","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/theming/"},{"en":"Build tools","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/build-tools/"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/webpack/"},{"en":"Accessibility","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/accessibility/"},{"en":"Layout","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/layout/overview/"},{"en":"Overview","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/layout/overview/"},{"en":"Grid","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/layout/grid/"},{"en":"Media object","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/layout/media-object/"},{"en":"Utilities for layout","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/layout/utilities-for-layout/"},{"en":"Content","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/content/reboot/"},{"en":"Reboot","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/content/reboot/"},{"en":"Typography","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/content/typography/"},{"en":"Code","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/content/code/"},{"en":"Images","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/content/images/"},{"en":"Tables","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/content/tables/"},{"en":"Figures","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/content/figures/"},{"en":"Components","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/components/alerts/"},{"en":"Alerts","hr